c Power) Magic Damage.\nGuinevere gains Super Magic stacks each time she deals damage. At max stacks, her next Basic Attack becomes a guided attack, dealing 80 (+100% Total Physical Attack) (+90% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and recovering 80 (+ 8% of her ).\nEnemies hit by Guinevere's skills or enhanced Basic Attack are marked for 5s. Enemies with 3 marks are knocked airborne when hit by Violet Requiem.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_bb87aa7f520dc67fcde6852598c241ca.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"},{"name":"Damage","rgb":"199,121,85"}]},{"id":8010,"name":"Energy Wave","description":"Guinevere releases an energy orb in the target direction, dealing 300 (+125% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and slowing enemies by 25% for 1.2s.\nSuccessfully hitting an enemy reduces all her skill cooldowns by 1s.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_193275791eb7f707158fc5e277a29016.png","video":null,"cd":4.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Damage","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":8020,"name":"Spatial Migration","description":"Guinevere leaps to the target location, dealing 250 (+80% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage. Enemy heroes and Creeps hit will be knocked airborne for 1s and take 125 (+50% Total Magic Power) additional Magic Damage.\nUse Again: Guinevere blinks toward the target direction and leaves an illusion behind. If the illusion takes damage by hero, it restores Super Magic for Guinevere and explodes after 1.5s, dealing 100 (+30% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5cd1df58957fa20b29e9c77d5b2067a9.png","video":null,"cd":17.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"},{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"}]},{"id":8030,"name":"Violet Requiem","description":"Guinevere creates a force field around her, gaining Control Immunity while attacking nearby enemies 11 times within 2s, dealing 880 (+385% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage in total.\nAirborne enemies hit will be knocked airborne again, up to 8 additional times.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6ad5e6561bec9562a72584c18191a76a.png","video":null,"cd":52.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Burst","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Guinevere works best with heroes with good single-target CC that will give her a better environment to farm and deal damage, such as Franco and Hylos.","heroes":[{"id":10,"name":"Franco","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9bed3c0095335606e0ce616c6e5a8553.png"},{"id":49,"name":"Hylos","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_195ad9af866afaab415ae23a6be13b45.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Guinevere is strong against heroes with poor sustainability or who are simply weak in the early game. This is because Guinevere can easily deliver her poking combo and escape. Heroes like Zilong and Silvanna are good examples here.","heroes":[{"id":16,"name":"Zilong","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9db57da4f0daef6d432676e4f19101ed.png"},{"id":90,"name":"Silvanna","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5e7b297af7c6e32a420b897aa4998071.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"But Guinevere is countered by heroes with CC immunities or strong CC skills. Since she needs to chain her CC to unleash her full damage potential, such as Badang and Chou.","heroes":[{"id":77,"name":"Badang","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a81815e34246147b672d48209089da9c.png"},{"id":26,"name":"Chou","head":"ht